#: dialogs/appearance-settings/main.c:1469
msgid ""
"The theme used for Xfce and other GTK applications. Some themes only affect GTK2/GTK3 applications, other themes as well affect GTK4 applications. Additional themes e.g. can be installed by the package manager of your distribution.\n"
"\n"
"Choosing a dark theme will set a GTK \"prefer-dark\" setting. Foreign applications can follow that setting, though not all of them will do so, depending on the used toolkit and the application preferences."
msgstr "Xfce un citu GTK lietotņu motīvs. Daži motīvi ietekmē tikai GTK2/GTK3 lietotnes, citi arī GTK4 lietotnes. Papildu motīvus var instalēt, piemēram, ar distribūcijas pakotņu pārvaldnieku.\n\nIzvēloties tumšu motīvu, tiek iestatīts GTK iestatījums „prefer-dark”. Citas lietotnes var tam sekot, taču ne visas to darīs — tas atkarīgs no izmantotās rīkkopas un lietotnes iestatījumiem."

